      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Max's grand romantic gesture backfires completely, leaving him trapped outside while Victoria goes back to work. Next time you watch the episode, listen for the Russian expressions for 'to see' and 'now' — you will catch every word right away. See you next time!",
